        "desc": "Battered enamel mug of tea sitting on a flat rock in the foreground left, chipped cream-white enamel with a thin blue rim, faint steam curling upward catching the warm side light."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Out-of-focus tuft of purple heather and yellow gorse slicing in from the bottom-right foreground edge, soft blurred color against the sharper midground."
